---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="联系我们 | 中科美利（苏州）包装设备有限公司"
  description="联系中科美利（苏州）包装设备有限公司，咨询饮料灌装生产线方案。"
  hideGlobalQuote
>
  <section class="contact-new-section">
    <div class="contact-new-inner">
      <div class="contact-new-header">
        <div class="contact-new-eyebrow">
          <span class="contact-new-tag">Get in touch</span>
          <span class="contact-new-rule"></span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="contact-new-heading">让我们了解您的项目需求</h1>
        <p class="contact-new-subhead">无论您需要灌装机、吹瓶机、水处理、贴标机、包装机还是整线方案，可通过以下方式发送项目需求，工程师团队将在 24 小时内回复。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-new-grid">
        <div class="contact-new-left contact-new-frame">
          <span class="contact-new-bracket tl"></span><span class="contact-new-bracket tr"></span>
          <span class="contact-new-bracket bl"></span><span class="contact-new-bracket br"></span>
          <div class="contact-new-bg-grid"></div>
          <div class="contact-new-left-inner">
            <div class="contact-new-card-tag">Contact channels</div>
            <h3>三种方式，直达工程师</h3>
            <p class="contact-new-desc">从瓶型设计到整厂交钥匙工程，一对一方案咨询，覆盖灌装、吹瓶、水处理、贴标、包装全流程。</p>

            <div class="contact-new-rows">
              <a class="contact-new-row" href="tel:18962223666">
                <div class="contact-new-icon-ring">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 2.5 7 2l1.8 5-1.5 1.1a10 10 0 0 0 4.3 4.3L12.7 11l5 1.8-.7 2.5c-.3 1-1.2 1.7-2.2 1.6-7-.8-13-6.8-13.6-15.2-.1-1.1 1.2-1 2-1.2Z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="contact-new-label">电话咨询 / Tel</div>
                  <div class="contact-new-value">189 6222 3666</div>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-new-go">→</div>
              </a>
              <a class="contact-new-row" href="mailto:manager@spring-pack.com">
                <div class="contact-new-icon-ring">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="5" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5"/><path d="m3 6.5 7 5.5 7-5.5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="contact-new-label">邮件咨询 / Email</div>
                  <div class="contact-new-value">manager@spring-pack.com</div>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-new-go">→</div>
              </a>
              <a class="contact-new-row" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=%E6%B1%9F%E8%8B%8F%E7%9C%81%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%B6%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E4%B9%90%E4%BD%99%E9%95%87%E4%B9%90%E4%B8%B0%E8%B7%AF179%E5%8F%B7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <div class="contact-new-icon-ring">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 17.5s7-5 7-10.5A7 7 0 0 0 3 7c0 5.5 7 10.5 7 10.5Z"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="contact-new-label">工厂地址 / Address</div>
                  <div class="contact-new-value contact-new-value--small">江苏省张家港市乐余镇乐丰路179号</div>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-new-go">→</div>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-new-right contact-new-frame">
          <span class="contact-new-bracket tl"></span><span class="contact-new-bracket tr"></span>
          <span class="contact-new-bracket bl"></span><span class="contact-new-bracket br"></span>
          <div class="contact-new-bg-grid contact-new-bg-grid--dark"></div>
          <div class="contact-new-right-inner">
            <div class="contact-new-status">
              <span class="contact-new-pulse"></span>
              <span class="contact-new-status-tag">Wechat · online</span>
            </div>
            <h3>扫码添加微信</h3>

            <div class="contact-new-qr-wrap">
              <svg class="contact-new-qr-frame" viewBox="0 0 216 216" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="6" y="6" width="22" height="22" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#2FAF66" stroke-width="2"/>
                <rect x="188" y="6" width="22" height="22" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#2FAF66" stroke-width="2"/>
                <rect x="6" y="188" width="22" height="22" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#2FAF66" stroke-width="2"/>
                <rect x="188" y="188" width="22" height="22" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="#2FAF66" stroke-width="2"/>
              </svg>
              <img src="/assets/first-machinery/contact/wechat-qr.webp" alt="微信二维码" width="180" height="180" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
            </div>

            <p class="contact-new-right-desc">使用微信扫码，直接发送瓶型、产能和项目需求，工程师为您提供一对一方案。</p>

            <div class="contact-new-checklist">
              <div class="contact-new-check-item">
                <span class="contact-new-check">✓</span>
                <span>24 小时内回复</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-new-check-item">
                <span class="contact-new-check">✓</span>
                <span>免费产线规划方案</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-new-check-item">
                <span class="contact-new-check">✓</span>
                <span>整厂交钥匙工程</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
